    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 2.5D+3D action RPG in which you become an investigator codenamed &quot;VIOLENCE DOLL&quot; and solve cases that occur around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a world where technological advances have led to the widespread use of humanoid cyborgs called &quot;Dolls&quot;. The protagonist is a Doll investigator who has solved many difficult cases, commonly known by the code name &quot;VIOLENCE DOLL&quot;. As the player manipulates &quot;VIOLENCE DOLL&quot; to solve cases that occur around the world, he will become embroiled in a huge conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.5D Field Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is made up of a side-scrolling 2.5D field and 3D real-time action battles. In the 2.5D field, you will progress by jumping, dashing, and using various items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/572688c9f026d8262d8a7f075ed38a00.poster.avif?t=1751653515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/572688c9f026d8262d8a7f075ed38a00.webm?t=1751653515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/572688c9f026d8262d8a7f075ed38a00.mp4?t=1751653515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D real-time action battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 3D real-time battle is characterized by hacking action, which allows you to stop the movement of enemies by hacking them and then launch a barrage of attacks in one go. Hacking actions can be easily activated with a single button, so they are the core action of battle, with various options available to players, such as using them to escape from a pinch or as an attack. In addition, the range of play styles can be further expanded by acquiring various skills and classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/b60f56905fb51219c3128c8116299f08.poster.avif?t=1751653515\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/b60f56905fb51219c3128c8116299f08.webp?t=1751653515\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=336 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 2.5D+3D action RPG in which you become an investigator codenamed &quot;VIOLENCE DOLL&quot; and solve cases that occur around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a world where technological advances have led to the widespread use of humanoid cyborgs called &quot;Dolls&quot;. The protagonist is a Doll investigator who has solved many difficult cases, commonly known by the code name &quot;VIOLENCE DOLL&quot;. As the player manipulates &quot;VIOLENCE DOLL&quot; to solve cases that occur around the world, he will become embroiled in a huge conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.5D Field Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is made up of a side-scrolling 2.5D field and 3D real-time action battles. In the 2.5D field, you will progress by jumping, dashing, and using various items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/572688c9f026d8262d8a7f075ed38a00.poster.avif?t=1751653515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/572688c9f026d8262d8a7f075ed38a00.webm?t=1751653515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/572688c9f026d8262d8a7f075ed38a00.mp4?t=1751653515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D real-time action battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 3D real-time battle is characterized by hacking action, which allows you to stop the movement of enemies by hacking them and then launch a barrage of attacks in one go. Hacking actions can be easily activated with a single button, so they are the core action of battle, with various options available to players, such as using them to escape from a pinch or as an attack. In addition, the range of play styles can be further expanded by acquiring various skills and classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/b60f56905fb51219c3128c8116299f08.poster.avif?t=1751653515\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843910/extras/b60f56905fb51219c3128c8116299f08.webp?t=1751653515\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=336 /></picture></span></p>",
